\title{Swarm command monad}
\import{swarm-macros}

\p{If #{\tau} is a type, \Cmd{\Phi}{\tau} is the type of commands which can be executed in [requirement context](000X) #{\Phi}, might have some effects, and will ultimately result in a value of type #{\tau}.}

\transclude{0018}  % Built-ins
